Zero point energy                ...      0.18284342 Eh     114.74 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.01146626 Eh       7.20 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
